1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:02,744
Apni sabse badi kamzori batao.

2
00:00:03,044 --> 00:00:04,490
Imaandaari, sahab.

3
00:00:04,790 --> 00:00:07,161
Imaandaari koi kamzori nahi hoti!

4
00:00:07,461 --> 00:00:10,543
Mujhe aapki raay se koi farq nahi padta.

5
00:00:10,843 --> 00:00:12,742
Sir, banda imaandaar to hai!
